---
interface Props { highlight?: 'spark' | 'pro' | 'agency' | 'partner'; }
Astro.props;
---

<div class="offer-status reveal" role="note">
  <strong>Current phase:</strong> paid design partners. Community and Pro packaging below
  describes the intended direction and remains subject to roadmap evidence and paid validation.
</div>

<div class="pricing-grid reveal">
  <article class="pricing-card current-offer">
    <div class="pricing-state">Available to accepted partners</div>
    <h3>Founding design partner</h3>
    <div class="pricing-price"><strong>$99</strong><span>/ year</span></div>
    <p class="pricing-audience">For agencies and operators bringing a real eligible incident.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Up to five authorised production sites</li>
      <li>Staging and local environments excluded from the site count</li>
      <li>Direct founder onboarding</li>
      <li>Regular evidence and issue review</li>
      <li>Advance notice before the final public tier applies</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/design-partner/" class="pricing-btn current-btn">Apply with a workflow</a>
    <p class="fine-print">No lifetime entitlement. Currency, tax, payment, cancellation, renewal, and refund terms are confirmed in writing before payment. Participation alone grants no trace-publication, testimonial, or case-study permission.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="pricing-card">
    <div class="pricing-state planned">Public-v1 direction</div>
    <h3>WP Flame Community</h3>
    <div class="pricing-promise">One useful diagnosis</div>
    <p class="pricing-audience">For reproducing a slow request and sharing supported evidence.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Manual bounded capture</li>
      <li>Interactive trace and supported span details</li>
      <li>Visible capability and limitation report</li>
      <li>Bounded recent local history</li>
      <li>Basic top-contributor findings</li>
      <li>Single-trace redacted export</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/community-vs-pro/" class="pricing-btn secondary-btn">Review the proposed boundary</a>
    <p class="fine-print">No account, expiry, or intentionally incomplete result is planned for the diagnosis workflow.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="pricing-card">
    <div class="pricing-state hypothesis">Packaging hypothesis</div>
    <h3>WP Flame Pro</h3>
    <div class="pricing-promise">Ongoing confidence</div>
    <p class="pricing-audience">For comparable workflows, longer history, reporting, and support.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Controlled automatic sampling</li>
      <li>Longer configurable history</li>
      <li>Route distributions and comparable traces</li>
      <li>Saved monitored workflows</li>
      <li>Client-ready redacted reports and CSV export</li>
      <li>Priority support</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/community-vs-pro/" class="pricing-btn secondary-btn">See what remains to validate</a>
    <p class="fine-print">Final price, site tiers, licensing, and feature boundary are not yet public commitments.</p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .offer-status { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 26px; padding: 16px 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--flame-400); background: rgba(240,122,24,.055); color: var(--carbon-200); font-size: 13px; }
  .offer-status strong { color: white; }
  .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; }
  .pricing-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 17px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.025); }
  .current-offer { border-color: rgba(240,122,24,.26); background: linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(240,122,24,.08),rgba(255,255,255,.02)); }
  .pricing-state { align-self: flex-start; color: var(--flame-300); background: rgba(240,122,24,.09); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 10px; font: 600 9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pricing-state.planned { color: #7ce8bd; background: rgba(52,212,152,.08); }
  .pricing-state.hypothesis { color: #b8a8ff; background: rgba(123,92,255,.1); }
  .pricing-card h3 { color: white; font-size: 23px; margin: 24px 0 14px; }
  .pricing-price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pricing-price strong { color: white; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; }
  .pricing-price span { color: var(--carbon-300); }
  .pricing-promise { color: white; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 13px; }
  .pricing-audience { color: var(--carbon-300); min-height: 70px; }
  .pricing-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 20px 0 28px; }
  .pricing-card li { color: var(--carbon-200); font-size: 13px; padding: 8px 0 8px 23px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05); position: relative; }
  .pricing-card li::before { content: '✓'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--flame-300); }
  .pricing-btn { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin-top: auto; min-height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px 14px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .current-btn { background: var(--flame-500); color: #171014; }
  .secondary-btn { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); color: white; }
  .fine-print { color: var(--carbon-300); font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.55; margin-top: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 950px) { .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .pricing-audience { min-height: 0; } }
</style>
